## Model card

- **Name:** MiniMax M3
- **Short description:** MiniMax flagship open-weight MoE (~230B total / 9.8B active) with 1M context and sparse attention; 59% SWE-Bench Pro, 66% Terminal-Bench 2.1.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen `minimax-ai/minimax-m3` — see meta.json
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026 per vendor docs; knowledge cutoff 2026-03
- **IDs:** `minimax-ai/minimax-m3`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M) / 512K out
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video in; text out
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** Paid $0.60/$2.40 per 1M — note: Paid $0.30/$1.20 per 1M (no Zen Free ID)
- **Architecture:** Proprietary

