### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 86/100.** Evidence Tau2 ~70% ; GDPval 1495 elite open; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 82/100.** Evidence GPQA 82% lineage; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 96/100.** 1,048,576 (1M) / 512K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 75/100.** Text, image, video in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 85/100.** Evidence SWE-bench Verified 76.5% ; VIBE 55.6% ; DeepSWE strong; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 60/100.** Paid $0.60/$2.40 per 1M.
- **Overall Score: 85/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (86+82+96+75+85)/5=84.8 → 85; best-fit per scoring methodology.

